event_inherited();
obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	"You ask about the errands and this whole president deal");

obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"So that guy who came in, Gambino, that's the student body president and he pretty much runs the school.
	[/page]But, he's up for reelection at the end of the week.
	", 
	"Job", spr_job_portrait_default
);
obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	"You ask who's running against him.");
obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"Nobody's dumb enough to.
	[/page]But Gambino likes to do this shit the right way.
	[/page]He's gonna make us all vote even though we know he's gonna win.
	", 
	"Job", spr_job_portrait_default
);
obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"Not on my watch he's not.
	[/page]With my right hand on the bible, I swear that I'll stop that tyrant from being re-elected!
	", 
	"Wei", spr_wei_portrait_furious_1
);
obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"Really? You're running?
	[/page]Do you even have a plan?
	", 
	"Job", spr_job_portrait_default
);
obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"McRonald reckons that Wei's plan is to bust out that wonderful punk tune that he wrote,
	[/page]in an attempt to rally the others against Gambino like a musical protagonist.
	", 
	"McRonald", spr_mcronald_portrait_default
);
obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"You're being sarcastic, aren't you?
	[/page]I'm telling you, it will work with God on our side!
	",
	"Wei", spr_wei_portrait_confusion
);
obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	"You ask what they're talking about");
	
obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"Oh, right. I don't think I've told you yet, Bobby.
	[/page]I play in a band with Frenchie and McRonald here.
	[/page]Frenchie's surprsingly into the same punk rock as I like. McRonald, on the other hand...
	", 
	"Wei", spr_wei_portrait_default
);

obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"Please, forgive McRonald, for he has yet to grasp the complex ethos of punk music.
	[/page]His caveman jazz brain is too dense to understand the beautiful simplicity of three chords...
	[/page]and a beat that resembles a family of racoons banging on trash cans.
	", 
	"McRonald", spr_mcronald_portrait_irritated
);


obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"I'm telling you! You kind of just play like you want to show off.
	Just play some simple basslines!
	", 
	"Wei", spr_wei_portrait_default
);

obj_scribble.textbox(
	"*Job comments that Frenchie wants to be a \"tough guy\"", 
	"Job", spr_job_portrait_default
);